g75tt_text","label":"ggTOk5g75tt_text","default":"<p>Reignite Your Masculine Drive: This Southeast Asian herb has been traditionally used to enhance male fertility and libido. Tongkat Ali may help support healthy testosterone levels, potentially boosting energy, mood, and sexual function.*</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7TRRwWb8J_text","label":"gg7TRRwWb8J_text","default":"<p>This clinically proven extract of Ashwagandha is a well-known adaptogen. By mitigating stress, KSM-66® Ashwagandha fosters an environment primed for peak muscle recovery and potentially maintains optimal testosterone levels, keeping your vitality surging.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDygp3RiHJ_text","label":"ggDygp3RiHJ_text","default":"Ashwagandha"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0l9gzbZRP_text","label":"gg0l9gzbZRP_text","default":"6426+ Studies | 300 mg in Premium Shilajit Alpha King"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVpEyHwpKQ_text","label":"ggVpEyHwpKQ_text","default":"<p>Conquer Stress &amp; Cortisol: This clinically studied extract of Ashwagandha is a powerful adaptogen. Adaptogens help your body better manage stress, which can hinder muscle growth and recovery. Ashwagandha may also support healthy testosterone levels, keeping your energy and vitality high.*</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaSTzyn4bM_text","label":"ggaSTzyn4bM_text","default":"<p>Nature's first food, brimming with nutrients and immune factors like immunoglobulins. Some studies suggest these powerhouses might bolster gut health, a key player in overall well-being.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyZQHcPaQY_text","label":"ggyZQHcPaQY_text","default":"Fenugreek"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLpTqUrX_0_text","label":"ggLpTqUrX_0_text","default":"7933+ Studies | 250 mg in Premium Shilajit Alpha King"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmkdV-REKw_text","label":"ggmkdV-REKw_text","default":"<p>Fuel Your Muscle Growth: This extract from fenugreek seeds is rich in saponins, compounds that may help increase testosterone levels and promote muscle growth. Fenugreek may also support healthy blood sugar levels and improve insulin sensitivity.*</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmDx6w5AKq_text","label":"ggmDx6w5AKq_text","default":"<p>This extract, derived from the Eurycoma Longifolia Jack plant, is a revered herb in Southeast Asian traditions. It may play a vital role in supporting healthy testosterone levels, potentially enhancing energy, libido, and physical performance.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggu9sdXI-AS_text","label":"ggu9sdXI-AS_text","default":"Red Panax Ginseng Extract"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmYXPTKLya_text","label":"ggmYXPTKLya_text","default":"10,963+ Studies | 100 mg in Premium Shilajit Alpha King"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHHguVfAgE_text","label":"ggHHguVfAgE_text","default":"<p>Sharpen Focus &amp; Endurance: This revered herb has been used for centuries to boost energy, enhance cognitive function, and improve physical performance. Ginseng may help reduce fatigue and support healthy blood flow, leading to better workouts and faster recovery.*</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3cD4n9ZZF_text","label":"gg3cD4n9ZZF_text","default":"<p>This black pepper extract, rich in piperine, may act as a bioavailability booster, ensuring your body absorbs more of the potent ingredients found within the Premium Turkesterone Advanced Formula.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaPD-EYYhZ_text","label":"ggaPD-EYYhZ_text","default":"Tribulus"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQDYHV2jgI_text","label":"ggQDYHV2jgI_text","default":"2,108+ Studies | 250 mg in Premium Shilajit Alpha King"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyeCXVxImD_text","label":"ggyeCXVxImD_text","default":"<p>Enhance Libido &amp; Performance: This extract from the Tribulus Terrestris plant is known for its potential to support healthy testosterone levels. Tribulus may also help improve sexual function, boost libido, and enhance athletic performance.*</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBh7Fi64Lv_text","label":"ggBh7Fi64Lv_text","default":"<p>This extract, derived from the Eurycoma Longifolia Jack plant, is a revered herb in Southeast Asian traditions. It may play a vital role in supporting healthy testosterone levels, potentially enhancing energy, libido, and physical performance.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRTvyT_M4z_text","label":"ggRTvyT_M4z_text","default":"Boron"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVfCbwD5FE_text","label":"ggVfCbwD5FE_text","default":"5,276+ Studies | 3mg in Premium Shilajit Alpha King"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeFlVRLFbq_text","label":"ggeFlVRLFbq_text","default":"<p>Optimize Hormone Balance: This essential trace mineral plays a crucial role in testosterone production and utilization. Boron may also help improve bone health and reduce inflammation.*</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJCnuomKyL_text","label":"ggJCnuomKyL_text","default":"<p>This black pepper extract, rich in piperine, may act as a bioavailability booster, ensuring your body absorbs more of the potent ingredients found within the Premium Turkesterone Advanced Formula.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggD5l1xHLsC_text","label":"ggD5l1xHLsC_text","default":"Magnesium"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBFJEH4o9R_text","label":"ggBFJEH4o9R_text","default":"83+ Studies | 100 mg in Premium Shilajit Alpha King"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfJnGtN9cR_text","label":"ggfJnGtN9cR_text","default":"<p>Relax &amp; Recover: This highly absorbable form of magnesium is essential for muscle function, energy production, and relaxation. Magnesium may also help reduce muscle cramps, improve sleep quality, and support overall well-being.*</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOpb4toFRZ_text","label":"ggOpb4toFRZ_text","default":"<p>This extract, derived from the Eurycoma Longifolia Jack plant, is a revered herb in Southeast Asian traditions. It may play a vital role in supporting healthy testosterone levels, potentially enhancing energy, libido, and physical performance.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggN59efG4U0_text","label":"ggN59efG4U0_text","default":"L-Citrulline"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxVeIWH5dz_text","label":"ggxVeIWH5dz_text","default":"23,892 Studies | 500 mg in 